# For bearing installation, press or tap the bearing (preference)

Standing user preference: For bearing installation, press or tap the bearing into the rotor bore using a drift; avoid applying side load.

## Conventions
- For bearing installation, press or tap the bearing into the rotor bore using a drift; avoid applying side load.

